# Mintlify component reference

Full syntax and examples: [docs/mintlify-reference.md](../../docs/mintlify-reference.md).
Full Mintlify docs: https://www.mintlify.com/docs/llms.txt

This file used to carry a full forked copy of the component reference. That copy drifted from
the canonical source (different example hrefs, missing sections) and is now removed to avoid
a second source of truth. Read `docs/mintlify-reference.md` directly — it covers:

- `docs.json` schema and redirects
- Callout components (Note, Tip, Warning, Info, Check) and when to use each
- Code groups, Steps, Tabs, Accordions
- Cards and card groups
- API documentation components (ParamField, ResponseField, Expandable)
- Frames, videos, tooltips, Updates (changelogs)

For component *selection* logic (which component fits which content), see
[docs/content-guidelines.md](../../docs/content-guidelines.md#component-selection).
